<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hylsamex raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hylsamex raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Wednesday it had raised its rating for Mexican steelmaker Hylsamex SA de CV to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares closed at 33.80 pesos on Tuesday in Mexico City.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
